{
 "about": "Test vectors of the Workbench settings descriptor (docs/plans/workbench-module-ui.md, 'Typed public settings'): patchkit's encoder (packages/patchkit/src/build/workbench), the runtime parser and the TypeScript decoder must agree. descriptors: workbench.toml text for the module `module` shown as `module_name`, and the binary descriptor patchkit makes from it as hex (byte 0 is 1 for text and file-name only, else 2). values: a stored value of one setting as hex and whether every reader accepts it (integer: 4 bytes i32 big-endian inside min..max on a step; boolean: one byte 0 or 1; choice: one byte below the label count; text: at most max_bytes bytes of UTF-8). rule says which rule the case tests.",
